# Your interns' working files never go in git. Memory is private, logs are noise.
agents/*/memory/*.md
!agents/*/memory/MEMORY.md
!agents/*/memory/questions.md
!agents/*/memory/log.md
agents/*/out/
team/inbox/*/
team/status/*
!team/status/.gitkeep
team/logs/
logs/
**/.claude/settings.local.json
team/.send-ok.json
team/.tick.lock
team/team.json
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.env
*.key
*.pem
/bin/
team/.approvals.json*
team/.send-ok.json.tmp
